Third-party software
--------------------
The application build bundles the following open-source packages, unmodified.
Exact versions are pinned in package-lock.json, and `npm run check:licences`
fails the build if a shipped package is not under an allowed licence.

  @noble/hashes            MIT
  @streamparser/json       MIT
  @tanstack/react-virtual  MIT   (with @tanstack/virtual-core, MIT)
  fflate                   MIT
  lucide-react             ISC
  react                    MIT   (with scheduler, MIT)
  react-dom                MIT
  react-resizable-panels   MIT
  saxes                    ISC   (with xmlchars, MIT)
  zod                      MIT
  zustand                  MIT

Development and test tools (TypeScript, Vite, Vitest, Playwright, ESLint,
Prettier, fast-check, papaparse and others listed in package.json) are used to
build and verify Tracewell and are not distributed with it.
